<div class="entry-content wp-block-post-content is-layout-flow wp-block-post-content-is-layout-flow"><?xml encoding="UTF-8"><div class="wp-block-cover hero text-shadow" style="padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0;min-height:940px;aspect-ratio:unset;"><img data-dominant-color="a87a95" data-has-transparency="false" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="2560" height="1707" sizes="(max-width: min(86%, 2560px)) 100vw, min(86%, 2560px)" class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-13752 size-full not-transparent" alt="" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025-09-11_JW_9-11_Remembrance_Ceremony_041-scaled.webp" style="--dominant-color: #a87a95; object-position:65% 33%" data-object-fit="cover" data-object-position="65% 33%" srcset="https://www.odni.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025-09-11_JW_9-11_Remembrance_Ceremony_041-scaled.webp 2560w, https://www.odni.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025-09-11_JW_9-11_Remembrance_Ceremony_041-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.odni.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025-09-11_JW_9-11_Remembrance_Ceremony_041-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.odni.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025-09-11_JW_9-11_Remembrance_Ceremony_041-150x100.webp 150w, https://www.odni.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025-09-11_JW_9-11_Remembrance_Ceremony_041-768x512.webp 768w, https://www.odni.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025-09-11_JW_9-11_Remembrance_Ceremony_041-1536x1024.webp 1536w, https://www.odni.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025-09-11_JW_9-11_Remembrance_Ceremony_041-2048x1366.webp 2048w"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim wp-block-cover__gradient-background has-background-gradient has-black-to-transparent-gradient-background"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-cover-is-layout-639b5052 wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained">
<div class="wp-block-group has-transparent-background-color has-background is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6c531013 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex"><h1 style="font-style:normal;font-weight:300;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:7.2px; border-bottom-width:4px;border-bottom-color:var(--wp--preset--color--odni-blue); margin-bottom:2rem;" class="has-link-color wp-elements-c246926fd11e64275b5428f7b6006fb9 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-white-color has-super-large-font-size has-aptos-font-family">Accountability</h1></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-old-standard-tt-font-family has-colossal-font-size wp-elements-f8de33d0d9fe2acf4f971b0b2c86c788" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1">Guided by Integrity.</h2>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-old-standard-tt-font-family has-colossal-font-size wp-elements-24019611f0798506f9fdc4c244d502df" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1">Upholding our<br>Constitutional Oath.</h2>
</div></div><div id="foia" class="wp-block-group fade-in block-bottom has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:6rem"><div style="--bb--crumb-gap:.4em;--bb--separator-color:var(--wp--preset--color--odni-blue);" class="wp-block-boldblocks-breadcrumb-block"><nav role="navigation" aria-label="Breadcrumbs" class="usa-breadcrumb usa-breadcrumb--wrap"><ol class="usa-breadcrumb__list"><li class="usa-breadcrumb__list-item"><a class="usa-breadcrumb__link usa-link" href="https://www.odni.gov/"><span>ODNI</span></a></li><li class="usa-breadcrumb__list-item usa-current" aria-current="page"><span>Accountability</span></li></ol></nav></div>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-odni-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-old-standard-tt-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-70c2c2dc6ca784b050c989a5d191183a" style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:3rem;padding-right:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none">Freedom of Information Act (FOIA)</h2>



<div class="wp-block-columns stack-on-tablet is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-cf05694f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column slide-left is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<p class="desktop:grid-col-10 has-medium-gray-color has-text-color has-link-color has-aptos-font-family has-large-font-size wp-elements-dcbadabaed40a67d58a4227cb844bfff" style="margin-bottom:2rem;line-height:1.6">The Freedom of Information Act (FOIA) is a law that gives you, the American people, the right to access information from the federal government.</p>



<p class="desktop:grid-col-8 has-dark-gray-color has-text-color has-link-color has-aptos-font-family has-medium-large-font-size wp-elements-4c62ad46a22b5637a89b53e6e9a50751" style="letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.44">ODNI accepts Freedom of Information or Privacy Act (PA) requests via electronic or hard copy submission.</p>



<p class="desktop:grid-col-8 has-dark-gray-color has-text-color has-aptos-font-family has-medium-large-font-size" style="letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.44">To obtain records from the ODNI, a FOIA or Privacy Act (PA) request may be submitted by emailing <a href="mailto:ODNI_FOIA@odni.gov">ODNI_FOIA@odni.gov</a> or in writing to:</p>



<p class="has-dark-gray-color has-text-color has-link-color has-aptos-font-family has-medium-large-font-size wp-elements-ddae3e8ae4905b38d344ff94f17c20f9">Rebecca Flowers<br>Acting Chief, Information Management Office<br>ATTN: FOIA/PA<br>Office of the Director of National Intelligence <br>Washington, D.C. 20511</p>



<p>Please include your name, contact information, and as much detail as possible for ODNI personnel to locate the requested records. Privacy Act requests require identity verification. <a href="https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-32/subtitle-B/chapter-XVII/part-1700?toc=1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="usa-link usa-link--external">ODNI FOIA Regulations<span class="usa-sr-only">(external link, opens in new tab)</span></a> provides further information on ODNI&rsquo;s procedures for disclosure of records pursuant to the FOIA.</p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column slide-right is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading has-very-dark-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-aptos-font-family has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-f73f94114d5385c46e4bbbe8b2e2a344" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold">FOIA Annual Reports</h4>



