<li><a href="https://archive.dni.gov/files/documents/CLPO/ODNI_Section_803_report_Jan2023-Dec2023.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="usa-link usa-link--external">Jan 2023 to Dec 2023<span class="usa-sr-only">(external link, opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
</ul>
</div>



