<li><a href="https://archive.dni.gov/files/documents/CLPO/Semiannual_803_Report_Jan-Jun_2022.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="usa-link usa-link--external">Jan 2022 to Jun 2022<span class="usa-sr-only">(external link, opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
</ul>
